'''Princess Zhivalka of Qym'''<!--FC: Merle Oberon--> (Zhivalka TBD TBD TBD ish Qym; DAY MONTH {{abbr|2300|1910.67 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} – DAY MONTH {{abbr|2329|1934.76 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}), was the younger daughter of [[Bacha XV of Qym|King Bacha XV]] and [[Queen Rumash of Qym|Queen Rumash]], and a sibling of [[Bacha XVI of Qym|King Bacha XVI]]. 

In MONTH {{abbr|2329|1934.76 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, [[Death of Princess Zhivalka|Zhivalka died]] after a car crash in [[Zhol]]; the incident led to extensive public mourning and had significant impacts on Qymish automotive and road safety regulations. 

[[Princess Zhivalka International Airport]], the second airport serving [[Zhol]], is named after her. 

==Death==
{{Main|Death of Princess Zhivalka}}

Zhivalka died on DAY MONTH {{abbr|2329|1934.76 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, {{abbr|aged 28|23.26 (Earth Age Equivalent)}}, as a result of injuries sustained in a car crash in the [[NAME]] neighborhood of [[Zhol]]. 

